      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "MORE IDEAS!\n\nGift Badge: Gift another other VRChat Plus for a month.\n\nGolden Gift Badge: Gift another user VRChat Plus for a year.\n\nQuestion Mark Badge: Utilize VRChat's Ask forum.\n\nEvent Badge: Attend a sponsored VRChat event, such as VKet.\n\nGroup Master Badge: Own a group with X amount of users. (permanent, even if the group is deleted or member count drops)\n\nCalendar Badge: Log into VRChat every day for X days in a row.\n\n\"Hello, world!\" Badge: Upload one VRChat world / VRCW.",
