      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I see that two more badges have been added to the system since the time of this post.\n\nOne for VRChat Alumni, and one for Crowdin and translation efforts.\n\nNot every example shown in the original post has to be implemented, as they are only examples to help drive creativity.\n\nEDIT: Three, also for the VRChat Wiki Contributors.",
