  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Identity pages could be expanded upon with more profile badges. The ones that currently exist are the Early Supporter badge, and Current Supporter badge. There's a lot of blank space to fill on the page though. Why should VRChat add more badges?\nThe purpose of this idea is to:\n1.) Drive more healthy community engagement, interaction, and collaboration; benefiting users and VRChat as a platform.\n2.) Personalize identity pages and their customization options.\nSome suggestions as to what to have as badges, could be ideas such as:\n\nJam Badge: Participate in a VRChat-sponsored Jam, such as Joke Jam or Spookality.\nFeedback Badge: Engage on VRChat's Canny, and have your original feedback ideas or bug reports placed in the Interested/Planned/In Progress phases.\nGolden Feedback Badge: Make recurrent feedback ideas and bug reports on Canny, helping VRChat move forward.\nFeatured Badge(?): Have a world or avatar be put in Spotlight, or get featured by VRChat via their social media or within the platform.\nGrass Badge: Possess 3 or more badges, and be offline for an extended period of time.\nNitro Badge: Boost VRChat's official Discord server.",
